From bda93f13ef590787d6dc473ad96d87f0902ad027 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hiper25 <whydonit@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:06:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: rc: Apply the active HK1 Android key semantics

The vendor map_0 low words are input codes interpreted by the active
Vendor_0001_Product_0001.kl, not final Linux desktop/media meanings.
Translate all mapped commands using that layout and omit ten unmapped
entries rather than emitting arbitrary modifier, letter or clipboard keys.

Preserve NEC address 0x04 and its command values. The resulting 41 keys
include BACK, homepage, volume, transport, guide and audio/subtitle keys.

Series validation: execute the unmodified registered rc-map and compare
all entries against stock DT plus the active Android layout. No handset
reception or Kodi navigation was exercised.

Change-Id: Id219d2420043037f99542f5c4670d9e9a5b2540a
---
 drivers/media/rc/keymaps/rc-hk1-rbox-x4.c | 51 ++++++++++-------------
 1 file changed, 21 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/rc/keymaps/rc-hk1-rbox-x4.c b/drivers/media/rc/keymaps/rc-hk1-rbox-x4.c
index 1156bbf4f6c860d14e032a6a3f9e39c5ad7268f8..99c6f7cdd942da1b90839f242c8ba69c7dc1a51a 100644
--- a/drivers/media/rc/keymaps/rc-hk1-rbox-x4.c
+++ b/drivers/media/rc/keymaps/rc-hk1-rbox-x4.c
@@ -1,7 +1,8 @@
 // SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+
 /*
- * HK1 RBOX X4 stock NEC keytable (sc2_ah212_4g, customcode 0xfb04).
- * Vendor words store command in bits 23:16 and Linux keycode in bits 15:0.
+ * HK1 RBOX X4 NEC map_0 (sc2_ah212_4g, customcode 0xfb04).
+ * Apply the active Vendor_0001_Product_0001.kl semantics to the vendor
+ * keycodes; omit entries that this Android layout leaves unmapped.
  * NEC address 0x04 and inverse 0xfb become rc-core scancodes 0x04xx.
  */
 
@@ -19,47 +20,37 @@ static struct rc_map_table hk1_rbox_x4[] = {
 	{ 0x040b, KEY_7 },
